# 本机设备配置样例。复制成 dm/ios/local.env（已在 .gitignore 里，不进仓）再填；也可放 ~/.config/dm-ios/local.env 供多个工作树共用。
# 真机的 devicectl 设备标识：xcrun devicectl list devices 的 Identifier 列（装机 / 真机脚本用）
# Sample local device configuration. Copy to dm/ios/local.env (already in .gitignore, not committed) and fill it in; it can also go in ~/.config/dm-ios/local.env to be shared by multiple working trees.
# devicectl device identifier of the real device: the Identifier column of xcrun devicectl list devices (used by the install / real-device scripts)
DM_DEVICE=
# 真机的硬件 UDID：Xcode → Devices and Simulators → Identifier。tools/lifecycle.sh、tools/xtrace.sh 用；
# 用免费账号（DM_FREE_ACCOUNT=1）出包时也要填：构建以这台手机为目标，苹果才肯给免费团队生成描述文件（构建时手机要连着）
# Hardware UDID of the real device: Xcode → Devices and Simulators → Identifier. Used by tools/lifecycle.sh, tools/xtrace.sh;
# it must also be filled in when building with a free account (DM_FREE_ACCOUNT=1): the build targets this phone, and only then will Apple generate a provisioning profile for a free team (the phone must be connected during the build)
DM_IOS_UDID=
# 第二台 Mac 的 ssh 目标（只有 dm/tools/l3run.sh、mini_sync.sh 用），如 用户名@主机
# ssh target of the second Mac (only used by dm/tools/l3run.sh and mini_sync.sh), e.g. user@host
MINI_SSH=
# 签名：开发者团队号（Xcode → Settings → Accounts 里团队的 Team ID）与 App 包名（自己起，反域名写法，如 org.example.d2rmobile）。
# App 组、iCloud 容器由包名派生（group.<包名>、iCloud.<包名>）。出 App 与装机脚本都要这两项。
# Signing: developer team ID (the Team ID of the team under Xcode → Settings → Accounts) and the App bundle ID (your own choice, reverse-domain style, e.g. org.example.d2rmobile).
# The App group and iCloud container are derived from the bundle ID (group.<bundle ID>, iCloud.<bundle ID>). Both the App build and the install scripts need these two.
DM_TEAM_ID=
DM_BUNDLE_ID=
# 用免费的开发者账号（个人团队）时设成 1：出包时不带它签不了的权限（iCloud 存档同步、持续执行、增加内存上限、扩展虚拟寻址）。
# 免费账号另有苹果的限制：描述文件 7 天过期（要重新构建重装）、最多 3 台设备、每台最多 3 个 App。付费账号留空。
# 用免费账号时：上面的 DM_IOS_UDID 也要填，构建时把手机连上；装好后第一次打开前，到手机「设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理」里信任你的开发者账号。
# Set to 1 when using a free developer account (personal team): the build then leaves out the entitlements it cannot sign (iCloud save sync, sustained execution, increased memory limit, extended virtual addressing).
# Free accounts also have Apple's own limits: the provisioning profile expires after 7 days (rebuild and reinstall needed), at most 3 devices, at most 3 apps per device. Leave empty for a paid account.
# When using a free account: DM_IOS_UDID above must also be filled in, and the phone must be connected during the build; after installing and before the first launch, trust your developer account on the phone under 「设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理」(Settings → General → VPN & Device Management).
DM_FREE_ACCOUNT=
